   726→        created: 2026-01-16T12:57:30.058Z
   727→        description: |-
   728→          kspec item patch <ref> [options]
   729→
   730→          Update spec item with JSON data.
   731→
   732→          Options:
   733→          - --data <json>: JSON object with fields to update
   734→          - --bulk: Read multiple patches from stdin (JSONL or JSON array)
   735→          - --fail-fast: Stop on first error in bulk mode (default: continue)
   736→          - --dry-run: Show what would change without writing
   737→          - --allow-unknown: Allow unknown fields (for extending format)
   738→
   739→          Single item mode:
   740→            kspec item patch @my-item --data '{"title": "New"}'
   741→            echo '{"title": "New"}' | kspec item patch @my-item
   742→
   743→          Bulk mode (JSONL or JSON array on stdin):
   744→            cat patches.jsonl | kspec item patch --bulk
   745→            echo '[{"ref":"@a","data":{...}}]' | kspec item patch --bulk
   746→
   747→          Validates input against SpecItemInputSchema (strict by default).
   748→        acceptance_criteria:
   749→          - id: ac-1
